# Requests about the screen and its content version (audit F-6 / AUD-007):
# 1) two "next page" in one turn: both done, the second is prepared against the
#    first one's receipt;
# 2) the person turns the page by hand while the hub is preparing "next page":
#    its call is refused as stale, the page stays where the person put it;
# 3) the hub sends the same request twice (a retry): the page turns once and
#    both answers are the same.
@3s      tap   80% 56%        # 阅读 (favourite)
+2500ms  tap   50% 44%            # 星星邮差: the second shelf row (reader-one-1)
+3s      mic   speech
+0       key   ai 1200ms          # turn 1
+9s      key   ai 1200ms          # turn 2: the tool call comes ~4 s after the press
+2s      key   next               # ... and the person turns the page first
+9s      key   ai 1200ms          # turn 3
+9s      end
